    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617600/extras/2b51eeb0d948432d8167d042efdabe32.poster.avif?t=1754908563\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617600/extras/2b51eeb0d948432d8167d042efdabe32.webm?t=1754908563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617600/extras/2b51eeb0d948432d8167d042efdabe32.mp4?t=1754908563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn. Build. Escape. Survive.</strong><br>In this casual strategy-survival game, you\u2019re stuck on a hostile planet where the only way out\u2026 is up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from scratch and build a thriving home that earns while you plan. Buy upgrades, invest in passive income sources, and protect your stash from creatures that come crawling when the sun sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is a chance to grow your empire. Each night, a test of how well you\u2019ve prepared. Will your fortress hold? Will your wealth last? Will you earn your freedom?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Earn and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Build your income engine from humble beginnings to massive money machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Base-Building</strong> \u2013 Place, upgrade, and defend your assets with smart resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Survive the Night</strong> \u2013 Monsters come out when it's dark. Build smart and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Escape the Planet</strong> \u2013 You\u2019re not just building to survive. You\u2019re building to leave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Casual Vibes, Real Strategy</strong> \u2013 Simple mechanics, deep choices. Perfect for quick sessions or long marathons.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfa8 The Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the game is carefully hand-drawn by the team and created by the team. From the music, the sound effects, to game design, the enemies, to the levels, the code, and everything in between is built from scratch by us! (yes, even voice acting!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617600/extras/2b51eeb0d948432d8167d042efdabe32.poster.avif?t=1754908563\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617600/extras/2b51eeb0d948432d8167d042efdabe32.webm?t=1754908563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617600/extras/2b51eeb0d948432d8167d042efdabe32.mp4?t=1754908563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 The Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn. Build. Escape. Survive.</strong><br>In this casual strategy-survival game, you\u2019re stuck on a hostile planet where the only way out\u2026 is up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from scratch and build a thriving home that earns while you plan. Buy upgrades, invest in passive income sources, and protect your stash from creatures that come crawling when the sun sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is a chance to grow your empire. Each night, a test of how well you\u2019ve prepared. Will your fortress hold? Will your wealth last? Will you earn your freedom?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Earn and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Build your income engine from humble beginnings to massive money machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f <strong>Strategic Base-Building</strong> \u2013 Place, upgrade, and defend your assets with smart resource management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Survive the Night</strong> \u2013 Monsters come out when it's dark. Build smart and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Escape the Planet</strong> \u2013 You\u2019re not just building to survive. You\u2019re building to leave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Casual Vibes, Real Strategy</strong> \u2013 Simple mechanics, deep choices. Perfect for quick sessions or long marathons.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfa8 The Art</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the game is carefully hand-drawn by the team and created by the team. From the music, the sound effects, to game design, the enemies, to the levels, the code, and everything in between is built from scratch by us! (yes, even voice acting!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
